{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-14_beg",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-14",
  "title": "'We'",
  "storyCode": "13-16",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-14_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "09437c69496a4cd739eaf3ecf0bf8e2d57b5a483c71c245366a621747f91ad49",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Good news? Or bad news?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Red",
      "text": "The good news is that the workshop is still intact, the forest hid it good. The dukes and the Sarkaz never got to use it as an outpost.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Red",
      "text": "The bad news is, someone's living there. We saw lights. I walked up, identified myself, and the lights went out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Might be refugees or deserters.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "But they put out the lights... that means they're wary of us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Warrior",
      "text": "Our fighters are ready for anything.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "text": "No, let's not be hasty. They might just be cautious, or fearful.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "text": "Don't jump to conclusions.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "And anyway, Red's carrying a pretty long blade. Anyone would want to play it safe.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Why don't I go? I'll have a word with them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "text": "By yourself?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "That's enough. The more men we send, the more nervous they'll be. Besides, if they mean us harm, a few more hands won't make a difference.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "The sky to the south has been red for the past few days. Percival and the others even found an Arts Circle...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "We need to move fast.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "text": "There's some risk in that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "I know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "But we made it out of Chernobog.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "text": "Fair enough.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "text": "We'll be ready to provide support on the sidelines, to make a breakthrough.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "This place was some kind of distillery before the Victorian Reunion settled in?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "I can already smell the booze. Romanich would've loved it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Hello. Anybody home?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Hi, I'm Guard. I've got a team nearby, I'm pretty sure you saw them earlier?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Don't worry, we mean no harm.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "The Victorian Reunion used to use this workshop to make medicine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "It brought hope to a lot of Infected around Londinium. Its medicine even circulated among the workers in the sewers below the city's industrial districts.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Whoever you are, you know the war is turning a lot more people Infected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "We want to get things going again here, to help them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Since you're occupying the place...\nWe need your cooperation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "We can provide medicine or other supplies. We'll trade fair.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion?",
      "text": "Reunion, you said?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Your clothes... who are you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion?",
      "text": "Mays.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Come in.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Look away, and clear out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Are you in charge here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "This place is under my control.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Let's find a place to talk.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Here we are. Nobody comes in here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "So you're Reunion, the real Reunion. You came from the north?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "From... Ursus?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Yes, Ursus, Columbia, and now we're in Victoria.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "That's a ways.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Your uniform, it's...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "I... used a bedsheet.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "I ran into a group from Ursus before. They said you dress like this. I think I got the emblem right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Looks a bit big.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Did you come here just to mock my handiwork?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "So you control this place just because you dressed up in the garb of the infamous 'Reunion'.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Let's get to the point. I don't have much time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "You want to get this place up and running again? To start making medicine?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Yes, if news got out that Reunion is running the place again...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "No.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Things are more complicated than you know. We have all kinds of people here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "I'm worn out breaking up the daily fights between Infected and uninfected. And you want to make Infected medicine? You might as well blow the place up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "It's hard to keep a balance between them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "You're Reunion, aren't you? At least, you claim to be.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "More or less.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Who are your people?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "What else would they be? Homeless Infected, war refugees, people who have lost everything. We all need a roof over our heads.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "I first came here with a few other Infected. We found this ruin.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Later, more people came, including some... less than honest folk. We don't take anyone else in anymore.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "I'm glad to see you, Reunion comrades, but I don't want to worry anyone here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Worry?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "That you're conspiring with us to wipe out the uninfected in our midst.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Whether or not it's just a pretext to get us to open our doors to you, we can trade supplies. But let's leave it at that...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "There are plenty of uninfected here, so I get what you're saying.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "But I still think it would be a good idea to talk it over with your people before you come to a decision. As long as we can get back to making medicine here, we can come to a long-term agreement—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "No, no thank you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Now, off with you. It was nice meeting you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "If you want to take this place, you're welcome to it. So long as you <i>can</i> take it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Alright then.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Hey, Reunion!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Yes?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Is Talulah with your group?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "...She is.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "I hear she has a nomadic city.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Does that city of hers only take Infected?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "If you haven't been infected, are you allowed to go there?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "I've heard... from the passing caravans, I've heard it's a nice place.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "We—There's some people here in less-than-ideal positions, refugees from the wilderness, orphans without a single relative. Talk of that Reunion city has everyone full of hope.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "But... you only stand with the Infected, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "A... city?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "There might be a misunderstanding here—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "text": "Mays! Do you know what they did?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "text": "Did you tell them to do it?! Have you gone mad?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "What are you talking about?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "text": "They—Those idiots!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "text": "He might've been a fighter in the war here! Or some big important figure, here to doom us all!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "text": "We might be just a couple hours out from a battalion of Sarkaz coming in here to wipe us out!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "What's going on?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "text": "You... Are you with Reunion, like Mays?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "text": "It was you, your people—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "text": "Those Infected, they killed a Sarkaz in the warehouse!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Bollocks!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "text": "He... He was Infected too... He's going to explode, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "text": "We need to deal with him!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "I'll take a look.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Go, quickly! You should be able to help!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indifferent Infected",
      "text": "He... he's dead. The Sarkaz aren't so strong.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indifferent Infected",
      "text": "Here... the medicine he had on him, and some stale bread.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Infected",
      "text": "He deserved it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Infected",
      "text": "You! You're with Reunion, aren't you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Infected",
      "text": "Mays never told us how we could join you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Why did you do it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Did he threaten you? Try to hurt you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Infected",
      "text": "Huh? Why?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Infected",
      "text": "When the Sarkaz burned our farm and humiliated my daughter, did anyone ask why?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "He wasn't a soldier. He wasn't a murderous devil from Kazdel. He was just a wandering hawker, selling his wares on the battlefields.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "He... even helped you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indifferent Infected",
      "text": "Huh, what does he mean? Was he Reunion too?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "I <i>am</i> Reunion.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "You lot must know what it is Reunion fights for.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indifferent Infected",
      "text": "Sure, you're fighting for all the Infected!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "This man that you tortured to death, the one who never even got a chance to share his name...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Wasn't he an Infected?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Angry Infected",
      "text": "But he was Sarkaz.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Hey, Guard, his corpse... it's glowing, he's about to disintegrate!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Get out of here! Now!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indifferent Infected",
      "text": "Run! Run!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Mays! How do you process the Infected here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "That room, the innermost one!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Hurry, we have to throw him in there!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Damn it, damn it all... I need a second, protection... for the nose, mouth, and wounds...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "No good, move, move!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "What are you doing?! Why is the body—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "There's too much Originium in here. How many Infected have been processed in this room?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "I... Well... it was years they were being processed in there!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "There's Originium dust in the air, the place won't survive a violent disintegration!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Get everyone out, now!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "text": "Wh-What?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Don't you get it? The Originium environment here is extremely unstable. The place could blow at any minute!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "text": "So we leave? And go where?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Refugee",
      "text": "Everything out there is—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "There's no time!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "We're talking about Reunion here! They have an entire bloody nomadic city!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Run, get them all moving!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "I've contacted some of our teams on the outskirts, they'll take some of you in!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Ugh, there's still some booze left in the distillery. If there's an explosion, the whole place is going with it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "And that—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Hey, Mays, where are you going?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "What are you doing here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "I'm... Hngh... Help me pull that lever...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Did you work here before? But you're not Infected!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Thanks for not exposing me! Hngh... pull harder!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Where did you get that Reunion outfit?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "This used to be a Reunion base, and so many died here... Don't test my patience!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "I... I didn't do anything!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "That's what they all say.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "I was... a worker here. That Reunion lot took over the distillery, and they needed hands to run the machines for them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "I... it's just, the mercenaries hired by the lord attacked, and I ran... I'm not Infected, why should I die here with those Reunion?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "So why did you come back?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Why?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Because I had nowhere else to go, dammit! What other reason would I end up trading my life for a secret distillery?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "I'm not Infected, but sometimes I feel like I'd rather be with Reunion! At least they have something to fight against, they have a purpose!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Pull harder! It's stuck!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "First, open the switch for this unloading port. Reunion left behind a whole lot of material!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "The doctor said this was the cheapest painkiller formula, they were working on it for a long time. It only relieves pain, but that's enough, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "With this... can I be a genuine part of Reunion?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "That is... I might be allowed a home in your nomadic city?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "We don't have a city.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "But, those Reunion guys all said—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "But, you... but...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "...Ahah... well...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "I mean... a nomadic city... a city, you know, we...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Take the herbs, we need to leave.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "There is no application to join Reunion. If you're willing to fight side-by-side with us, you're already Reunion.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "But... I'm not Infected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "It's not only the Infected who want to resist.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "And besides, I need you to help me figure out who killed that Sarkaz man.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "They need to be punished.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Now come on, let's go!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "We're almost there, quickly now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mays",
      "text": "Agh! My—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Take them... and go.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "The exit is right ahead, don't lose them this time, I might've... crushed some of the petals, give them to a woman named Nine, she knows what to do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Don't dawdle, move.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Nine, Red, Percival, Talulah, guh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "I'm not sure if I'll be burned to cinders by the time you find me, but I hope this recorder survives.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "You ask—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Are we fighting for all the 'Infected'?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Whether they're despicable, upper class, or even... royalty?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Or... are the people we unite with, the people we want to fight alongside—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Only the Infected?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Only... them?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
